1845383656389452","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3060830-1845383656388632","game_id":"steam-3060830","kind":"announcement","title":"《降临之地》版本更新说明","summary":"《降临之地》版本更新说明 一、 基础规则与战斗调整 1. 增加击破属性上升规则 击破 Boss 标记时，除了原有的行动力奖励外，全牌堆所有卡牌额外获得 1 点【攻击上升】与 1 点【生命上限上升】。 2. 备战结算顺序调整 击破 Boss 标记后的奖励结算时机，调整为在备战手牌全部落位并完成揭示之后执行。 备战区卡牌入场时间线与击破奖励演出播放结束前，锁定备战操作与进攻按钮；演出完毕后自动开放交互。 二、 卡牌与遗物平衡性调整 1. 义警加强 【复仇】技能生效目标数量由 1 张提升至 2 张（令场上最左侧的最多 2 张受伤卡牌，分别对 Boss 造成其已损失生命值 100% 的伤害）。 2. 凝血圣杯加强 【批量入场】时，卡牌行动力消耗降低幅度由 50% 调整为 90%。 3. 天使之卵加强 触发所需卡牌商店刷新次数由 5 次降低为 4 次。 触发效果调整为：令最多两张随机卡牌降低 1 点费用，并额外施加 +3 生命上限。 4. 圣饼削弱 击破时为全牌堆所有卡牌施加的属性提升由 +2 攻击 / +2 生命上限 调整为 +1 攻击 / +1 生命上限。 三、 首领与关卡调整 1. 虔诚削","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T08:39:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388632","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3060830-1845383656386652","game_id":"steam-3060830","kind":"update","title":"Realm of Advent - Demo 0.4 Major Patch Notes","summary":"Hello everyone! A new major update for Realm of Advent is now live! This patch introduces significant core system improvements, brand new cards and relics, as well as extensive reworks and balance tuning across various builds. I. Core System & Rule Overhauls 1. In-Combat Death Stat Penalty Rule Implementation：In combat, friendly cards that die and trigger Death Whisper have their permanent Attack, max Health, and Cost reduced by 20% for the rest of that battle. Details：Stacks on repeated deaths.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T15:03:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386652","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","conte